WEBVTT

00:00:02.030 --> 00:00:04.330
Grom leader to Kamchatsky control.

00:00:04.330 --> 00:00:06.520
Requesting final conformation of orders.

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:08.470
Kamchatsky control to Grom Leader.

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:11.380
All allies have retreated 
from the attack target.

00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:12.590
You are clear to go.

00:00:12.590 --> 00:00:14.480
Repeat: You are clear to go.

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:26.110
If I bring it back like this, 
even Vincent will be mad at me.

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:35.320
Damn, I guess the BETA like me.

00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:43.680
Thanks for the offer, partner.

00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:47.800
But I made her a promise.

00:00:48.990 --> 00:00:52.200
That I'd take you back.

00:00:52.770 --> 00:00:55.610
Let's go, Shiranui!

00:01:07.570 --> 00:01:08.210
The engine?

00:01:14.670 --> 00:01:15.520
Damn it!

00:01:18.710 --> 00:01:19.620
What?

00:01:19.970 --> 00:01:22.840
Looks like you're having a good time, kid.

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:26.840
Commander Latrova...

00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:30.700
Companies 2 and 3 are to clear the base.

00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:35.260
Zhar 5 will take command of Company 1 and 
provide air cover at maximum altitude.

00:01:35.260 --> 00:01:36.120
Roger.

00:01:36.720 --> 00:01:40.030
Let's show these lesser 
lifeforms their place.

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:14.920
<b>An Eishi's Honor</b>

00:03:20.160 --> 00:03:21.200
I...

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:26.060
Can you hear me?

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:29.940
Looks like a rough fight.

00:03:31.350 --> 00:03:33.050
Their comms are online.

00:03:33.520 --> 00:03:36.710
Does that mean you're part 
of this too, Commander?

00:03:38.600 --> 00:03:40.670
Looks like you've grown up a little.

00:03:41.170 --> 00:03:42.450
It must've been a good experience.

00:03:43.010 --> 00:03:46.270
Thank you, Commander.  You saved me.

00:03:46.740 --> 00:03:49.440
But how did you find me without a datalink?

00:03:49.440 --> 00:03:51.960
And how can you use your 
communication systems anyway?

00:03:52.600 --> 00:03:58.910
This base has been long-abandoned, and 
the whole area is under heavy jamming.

00:03:58.910 --> 00:04:00.140
I'm aware.

00:04:01.390 --> 00:04:04.430
Some idiot panicked on his way out.

00:04:05.090 --> 00:04:07.720
It was bothering me so I blew 
up the communication tower.

00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:08.990
What?

00:04:08.990 --> 00:04:10.680
And then what did I see?

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:14.360
Some idiot playing around with the BETA.

00:04:14.970 --> 00:04:18.520
You fired a signal round, why are you 
getting mad at me for responding?

00:04:20.160 --> 00:04:23.000
I told you to keep an eye on the big picture.

00:04:23.310 --> 00:04:26.980
I don't want to hear about every paranoid 
idea that comes into your head.

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:28.990
Zhar 2 to Zhar 1.

00:04:30.190 --> 00:04:33.670
A huge group of BETA are gathered 
around the hangar block.

00:04:34.380 --> 00:04:36.840
It's strange; they're barely moving.

00:04:38.090 --> 00:04:42.170
Those coordinates... that's 
where I lost the core module.

00:04:45.950 --> 00:04:47.970
There's even more of them heading there.

00:04:47.970 --> 00:04:51.350
Every BETA in this area is heading there.

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:54.030
If they all start moving...

00:04:57.310 --> 00:04:58.570
They're finally here?

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:01.460
Are those bombers?

00:05:01.460 --> 00:05:02.560
Why now?

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:11.560
Well, if they blast the ones in 
the rear that'll make this easier.

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:16.080
Cleaning out the base will 
still be a pain in the ass.

00:05:17.240 --> 00:05:20.820
They can't clear out the BETA inside 
the facilities with bombers.

00:05:21.290 --> 00:05:23.600
There's a chance to get the core module back.

00:05:23.960 --> 00:05:26.550
Nobody needs their help.

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:28.010
We could do this ourselves.

00:05:28.420 --> 00:05:31.650
What?  You wet your pants when 
you heard Tasha's report.

00:05:31.650 --> 00:05:33.960
The hell I did. I'm fine.

00:05:39.700 --> 00:05:40.990
Isn't that too early?

00:05:41.420 --> 00:05:43.060
Why...?

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:55.250
No way!

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:56.260
They're attacking the base?

00:05:56.710 --> 00:05:58.070
They can't be-

00:05:58.700 --> 00:06:00.760
Everyone try to get away from the bombs!

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:01.250
Hurry!

00:06:14.770 --> 00:06:16.030
Stop!

00:06:16.030 --> 00:06:17.810
Can't you see our friendly markers?

00:06:18.340 --> 00:06:19.800
We shut off the jamming!

00:06:20.090 --> 00:06:22.090
So why?

00:06:24.920 --> 00:06:25.820
Nikolai!

00:06:29.760 --> 00:06:31.590
No...

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:35.650
This is for Nikolai!

00:06:37.190 --> 00:06:39.140
Tasha! Why are you stopping me?

00:06:39.140 --> 00:06:41.340
They know we're here!

00:06:41.690 --> 00:06:45.690
If you deliberately open fire on friendly 
bombers, the whole battalion will be punished!

00:06:45.690 --> 00:06:47.850
Are you going to take the 
Commander down with you?

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:49.180
But...

00:06:49.890 --> 00:06:50.830
But...

00:06:55.330 --> 00:06:57.840
What?  Laser warnings?

00:07:05.030 --> 00:07:07.250
Go lower, Tatiana!

00:07:10.310 --> 00:07:11.750
Tatiana!

00:07:12.940 --> 00:07:14.000
What?

00:07:16.450 --> 00:07:19.030
Those were lasers...

00:07:21.190 --> 00:07:23.260
Markers lost!

00:07:23.260 --> 00:07:25.430
All bombers have been shot down!

00:07:25.430 --> 00:07:27.760
We can't tell how many 
Laser Class are out there!

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:30.170
Wiped out?

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:34.460
Those bombers are what's given us 
the advantage on the Far East front!

00:07:34.460 --> 00:07:36.170
And we've lost them all?

00:07:36.700 --> 00:07:40.190
Why would the Laser Class only appear now?

00:07:40.190 --> 00:07:41.930
There are many theories.

00:07:41.930 --> 00:07:45.630
They are high energy bodies that 
cannot be created by young hives.

00:07:45.630 --> 00:07:48.690
Or they lack the ability to 
cross large bodies of water.

00:07:49.010 --> 00:07:54.700
It just goes to show that humanity 
still has much to learn about the BETA.

00:07:55.110 --> 00:07:58.030
That's not what I'm asking!

00:07:58.390 --> 00:08:01.700
What will you do, Comrade Rogofsky?

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:03.330
What?

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:07.950
You've lost a front-line 
base, attacked your own side,

00:08:07.950 --> 00:08:11.390
and then wiped out our 
all-important bomber forces...

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:15.290
Give Zhar Battalion permission to retreat!

00:08:15.290 --> 00:08:16.530
Now!

00:08:16.530 --> 00:08:17.770
It's too late for that.

00:08:18.550 --> 00:08:22.250
Would you allow me to handle that?

00:08:22.630 --> 00:08:25.920
Are you going to tell the Party?

00:08:25.920 --> 00:08:27.090
Of course not.

00:08:27.090 --> 00:08:28.780
Then what?

00:08:28.780 --> 00:08:31.120
This is your plan.

00:08:31.120 --> 00:08:33.020
Carry it out with confidence.

00:08:33.020 --> 00:08:34.280
What?

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:38.490
With the Laser Class, the greatest threat 
we face, out there on the battlefield,

00:08:38.490 --> 00:08:42.360
the USSR needs a real hero.

00:08:42.360 --> 00:08:44.280
Don't you think?

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:48.080
Zhar 1 to all troops.

00:08:49.710 --> 00:08:54.150
Continue to wipe out the BETA 
and gather on my position.

00:08:54.150 --> 00:08:55.890
Keep a close eye on the area around you.

00:08:55.890 --> 00:08:56.920
Roger.

00:08:57.370 --> 00:09:00.680
It's ironic... those BETA saved us.

00:09:02.280 --> 00:09:04.410
We still haven't been given 
the order to retreat.

00:09:04.410 --> 00:09:06.190
I guess they're going to sacrifice us.

00:09:07.540 --> 00:09:09.500
Watch over me, everyone.

00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:11.520
I'll take revenge for you.

00:09:13.170 --> 00:09:15.770
Commander, I want to ask you something.

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:18.380
A secure channel?

00:09:18.380 --> 00:09:19.700
It must be something pretty grim, kid.

00:09:20.500 --> 00:09:22.720
What is the USSR Military really after?

00:09:23.350 --> 00:09:25.450
Please.  Tell me.

00:09:25.450 --> 00:09:29.090
You're suffering from this 
stupid plan too, right?

00:09:29.410 --> 00:09:30.220
What are you talking about?

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:32.940
The retreat from the base 
went a little too smoothly.

00:09:32.940 --> 00:09:34.290
Then the jamming.

00:09:34.290 --> 00:09:36.700
The bombers should've gotten 
here first, but they were late.

00:09:37.030 --> 00:09:38.210
It's all too good to be true.

00:09:38.610 --> 00:09:40.220
More paranoid fantasies?

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:44.150
There's more going on in this 
world than just what you see.

00:09:44.630 --> 00:09:49.180
Then did I just fantasize them 
leaving the holes the BETA dug?

00:09:50.240 --> 00:09:54.650
What's so important that the Soviets are 
willing to sacrifice so many of their own for it?

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:56.160
I told you before.

00:09:56.160 --> 00:09:57.800
Know your place.

00:09:57.800 --> 00:10:00.080
Your own men are being killed.

00:10:00.580 --> 00:10:01.790
How can you be so calm?

00:10:01.790 --> 00:10:03.030
What are you?

00:10:04.010 --> 00:10:05.520
You're an Eishi.

00:10:06.130 --> 00:10:09.550
The Eishi are the edge of humanity's blade.

00:10:09.550 --> 00:10:13.060
It's not their job to get 
involved in politics.

00:10:13.270 --> 00:10:15.790
Your men are being killed.

00:10:15.790 --> 00:10:17.970
It's fine to talk about 
Justice and what's "right".

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:21.880
But if you get too involved you'll 
lose what's important to you.

00:10:31.120 --> 00:10:32.090
Always.

00:10:32.620 --> 00:10:33.770
Commander.

00:10:33.770 --> 00:10:35.710
That's not the place for you.

00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:38.070
What is the task of an Eishi?

00:10:38.070 --> 00:10:39.520
That's all you need to think about.

00:10:39.520 --> 00:10:41.120
And it's all you need to do.

00:10:41.860 --> 00:10:45.180
I'll make sure the 94 
Second makes it back okay.

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:49.050
Got it?

00:10:49.050 --> 00:10:50.620
Commander, you...

00:10:53.930 --> 00:10:55.530
We're here, Commander.

00:10:55.950 --> 00:10:57.960
We've detected major heat 
signatures on the move.

00:10:57.960 --> 00:10:59.730
The Lasers are getting closer.

00:11:07.750 --> 00:11:09.030
Kayl, Tonya.

00:11:09.380 --> 00:11:11.810
Take the boy to the rest of his group.

00:11:13.130 --> 00:11:15.090
After your complete your mission,

00:11:15.090 --> 00:11:18.280
meet up with Commander Balakin's 
squads and follow their orders.

00:11:18.630 --> 00:11:20.890
What are you saying, Commander?

00:11:20.890 --> 00:11:22.190
We-

00:11:22.190 --> 00:11:23.840
I don't need to explain my orders.

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:27.100
Roger.

00:11:27.100 --> 00:11:28.620
Wait, Commander?

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:29.360
I still...

00:11:29.360 --> 00:11:31.060
Shut up, useless idiot!

00:11:31.060 --> 00:11:33.940
Your TSF can barely move.  What could it do?

00:11:33.940 --> 00:11:38.050
That's right.  You're just 
slowing the rest of us down!

00:11:38.940 --> 00:11:42.670
Damn!  I hate to say it but they're right.

00:11:43.210 --> 00:11:45.180
I'm counting on you both.

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:47.130
Leave it to us, Commander.

00:11:47.700 --> 00:11:49.630
Please stay safe.

00:11:54.630 --> 00:11:56.970
First accept reality.

00:11:57.490 --> 00:11:59.660
It's not too late to choose then.

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:08.620
If he's still alive on some battlefield 
somewhere, is that what he'd look like?

00:12:12.440 --> 00:12:14.600
Commander, we're here.

00:12:24.960 --> 00:12:28.970
Now then... It's time for me 
to do my job as an Eishi too.

00:12:29.900 --> 00:12:31.140
Everyone's here, right?

00:12:31.590 --> 00:12:33.300
Listen up, everyone!

00:12:33.300 --> 00:12:36.700
We will now proceed to 
wipe out the Laser Class.

00:12:37.290 --> 00:12:39.870
Wipe out the Laser Class?

00:12:40.310 --> 00:12:42.230
With this base fallen,

00:12:42.230 --> 00:12:44.850
if the Lasers aren't wiped out,

00:12:44.850 --> 00:12:48.460
the whole Far East Absolute 
Defense Line will crumble.

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:52.240
But I'm certain of this:

00:12:52.240 --> 00:12:54.870
Zhar Battalion is the only group capable

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:58.870
of being the first ones to wipe 
out the Lasers on this front.

00:13:01.180 --> 00:13:03.370
They will never fire on their own allies.

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:09.410
Use the terrain and the other BETA as cover 
to get close, and then hit them from the side.

00:13:09.750 --> 00:13:11.380
We'll wipe them out in one hit.

00:13:12.150 --> 00:13:14.100
Just like in training!

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:15.140
Roger!

00:13:18.190 --> 00:13:20.400
So they've sent someone here 
to keep us from talking?

00:13:21.100 --> 00:13:22.480
The fools.

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:25.390
Our biggest priority here is 
to take out the Laser Class!

00:13:27.680 --> 00:13:30.170
They must be pretty good if they're 
sending one TSF against a Battalion.

00:13:31.100 --> 00:13:32.930
Zhar 1 to all units.

00:13:32.930 --> 00:13:34.520
I will be the rear guard.

00:13:35.060 --> 00:13:38.040
Zhar 2 will take the lead.  
Formation Arrowhead 1.

00:13:38.820 --> 00:13:42.720
Commander, what do we do about 
the unknown approaching?

00:13:42.720 --> 00:13:44.550
It's probably delivering 
a top-secret message.

00:13:45.150 --> 00:13:46.770
I'll deal with them.

00:13:46.770 --> 00:13:49.770
You focus on wiping out the lasers.

00:13:49.770 --> 00:13:50.170
Yes ma'am.

00:13:51.030 --> 00:13:54.020
Keep a close eye on the surrounding 
terrain and your altimeter!

00:13:54.390 --> 00:13:56.030
Battalion, advance!

00:13:56.030 --> 00:13:57.170
Roger!

00:14:04.080 --> 00:14:05.100
I'm counting on you.

00:14:16.130 --> 00:14:19.060
This is far enough, right?

00:14:19.060 --> 00:14:20.570
Yes, thank you.

00:14:21.260 --> 00:14:23.020
I'm grateful for your help.

00:14:23.330 --> 00:14:24.660
You saved my life.

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:27.820
I-I don't need your thanks!

00:14:27.820 --> 00:14:30.330
If it wasn't for the Commander's 
orders, I would never help you.

00:14:30.600 --> 00:14:32.530
Yeah, that's right.

00:14:33.380 --> 00:14:36.170
Tonya, let's get back to the others.

00:14:36.540 --> 00:14:40.020
Wait, your orders were to meet 
up with the base commander.

00:14:40.020 --> 00:14:41.130
Shut up.

00:14:41.130 --> 00:14:43.440
She's our only commander!

00:14:43.880 --> 00:14:46.280
It's not the USSR we want to protect.

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:47.410
It's our family.

00:14:47.410 --> 00:14:49.210
Shut up, outsider.

00:14:49.210 --> 00:14:50.230
You guys...

00:14:50.490 --> 00:14:51.780
Listen up, asshole.

00:14:51.780 --> 00:14:54.920
You need to make sure you 
make it to your friends.

00:14:54.920 --> 00:14:56.670
Those were the Commander's orders.

00:14:57.060 --> 00:14:58.960
Don't collapse and die on the way there.

00:14:59.400 --> 00:15:01.000
It would annoy me.

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:02.950
You too, brats.

00:15:07.020 --> 00:15:09.210
Don't die.

00:15:19.050 --> 00:15:22.060
Hold out till I make it 
to the base, Shiranui...

00:15:31.200 --> 00:15:33.920
So they're heading straight 
here without firing from range.

00:15:35.170 --> 00:15:37.400
They want to fight me close up, one-on-one?

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:48.760
They're terrifyingly strong.

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:52.220
But their overconfidence 
will cost them their lives.

00:15:53.110 --> 00:15:57.900
Sorry to spoil your fun, but I don't 
have time for foolish romanticism.

00:15:59.410 --> 00:16:02.780
I apologize for interrupting, Commander.

00:16:03.260 --> 00:16:07.050
I don't know who you are, but if 
you're trying to interrupt me,

00:16:07.050 --> 00:16:10.030
I'm afraid my powers of concentration 
are stronger than that.

00:16:10.030 --> 00:16:11.240
Not at all.

00:16:11.240 --> 00:16:13.780
I was thinking of giving you some advice.

00:16:14.090 --> 00:16:17.780
Please fight with every 
intention of killing them.

00:16:17.780 --> 00:16:23.530
Do not try to take away their ability 
to fight, then take them alive.

00:16:24.550 --> 00:16:26.550
That TSF can't be...

00:16:27.870 --> 00:16:34.680
Otherwise, you'll be meeting 
your deceased husband soon.

00:16:35.390 --> 00:16:37.070
Oh, excuse me.

00:16:37.070 --> 00:16:41.550
Would that be what you wanted?

00:16:47.600 --> 00:16:52.230
<b>UN Far North Naval Theatre 6th Army
Petropavlovsk-Kamchatsky Base</b>

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:57.490
They're all a wreck.

00:16:57.490 --> 00:16:59.500
It was that hard a fight.

00:17:00.050 --> 00:17:03.480
But sempai, the 94 Second still hasn't...

00:17:04.310 --> 00:17:05.460
That's right.

00:17:06.400 --> 00:17:08.970
You've never had this happen to you before.

00:17:10.450 --> 00:17:11.750
You're kidding me.

00:17:14.520 --> 00:17:20.760
Yuuya did everything he could with his 
battered TSF to save me and the Lieutenant.

00:17:21.050 --> 00:17:22.050
But...

00:17:22.050 --> 00:17:24.270
I want to believe in miracles too.

00:17:24.270 --> 00:17:26.260
But in that situation...

00:17:28.070 --> 00:17:29.930
It's not your fault.

00:17:29.930 --> 00:17:31.770
I don't know if this is possible, 
but don't let it get to you.

00:17:32.800 --> 00:17:35.530
You and Yuuya saved Princess Yui.

00:17:36.790 --> 00:17:39.040
Just focus on that for now.

00:17:39.040 --> 00:17:41.060
And be proud of it.

00:17:41.410 --> 00:17:42.390
VG...

00:17:43.130 --> 00:17:46.410
You can be proud when you 
tell others how Yuuya lived.

00:17:47.060 --> 00:17:50.160
That's an how Eishi should be.

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:54.260
You're still here?

00:17:54.260 --> 00:17:54.850
Lieutenant...?

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:56.970
But Yuuya still...

00:17:56.970 --> 00:18:01.020
And do you think if you just stay here 
and wait, Bridges will come back?

00:18:01.020 --> 00:18:01.830
Well...

00:18:02.310 --> 00:18:03.390
We got a message.

00:18:03.960 --> 00:18:06.120
With the Laser Class here in theatre,

00:18:06.120 --> 00:18:10.550
the UN has decided to call off 
the exercises immediately.

00:18:10.550 --> 00:18:14.850
The Soviets have asked us to be 
completely out of here in 24 hours.

00:18:16.290 --> 00:18:18.960
It's true that we're in the way, but...

00:18:18.960 --> 00:18:20.140
But...

00:18:28.940 --> 00:18:31.690
It's gotta be tough for Princess Yui.

00:18:31.690 --> 00:18:32.820
Yeah.

00:18:33.290 --> 00:18:35.180
Leave her alone for now.

00:18:35.180 --> 00:18:36.100
Let's go.

00:18:38.130 --> 00:18:39.060
Yuuya...

00:18:41.430 --> 00:18:45.590
I'm the leader of the XFJ plan.

00:18:46.780 --> 00:18:52.380
I can't just remain focused 
on my own desires forever...

00:19:08.430 --> 00:19:09.330
What's that?

00:19:32.180 --> 00:19:33.440
Yuuya!

00:19:33.440 --> 00:19:35.840
Look, it's Yuuya!

00:19:35.840 --> 00:19:38.360
You had us worried, damn it!

00:19:38.360 --> 00:19:41.700
You're late!

00:21:17.620 --> 00:21:20.500
<b>August 28th 2001</b>

00:21:21.150 --> 00:21:25.100
I believe there is a trust that can only 
exist between those who have fought one another.

00:21:25.100 --> 00:21:31.010
I believe there is a friendship that can 
only exist between those who have crossed swords.

00:21:31.760 --> 00:21:37.070
And here today, the bonds between America 
and Japan, the very souls of the two nations,

00:21:37.070 --> 00:21:41.020
appear before us in the form of 
a radiant and powerful giant.

00:21:41.880 --> 00:21:46.870
Let me introduce you to the new blade 
of the Japanese Empire, and of humanity!

00:21:46.870 --> 00:21:51.520
The XFJ-01a, Shiranui Second Phase 2!

00:22:38.520 --> 00:22:43.280
What do you think of the reborn 94 Second, 
with its new Missip Enhancement Module?

00:22:43.720 --> 00:22:46.940
It's amazing.  A beautiful machine.

00:22:48.950 --> 00:22:52.600
I never thought I'd see the day when you 
described a Japanese TSF as "beautiful".

00:22:53.310 --> 00:22:54.010
Yeah.

00:22:54.880 --> 00:22:58.270
It just shows that up till now I've 
been a kid who didn't know his place.

00:22:59.670 --> 00:23:03.580
I think I've learned a lot about why I exist.

00:23:03.930 --> 00:23:05.030
Commander Latrova?

00:23:06.750 --> 00:23:09.380
The Zhar Battalion was wiped out?

00:23:10.050 --> 00:23:14.620
They went to wipe out the Laser 
Class after they helped you escape.

00:23:15.180 --> 00:23:16.310
In that situation?

00:23:16.750 --> 00:23:19.560
All the Laser Class were wiped out,

00:23:19.560 --> 00:23:22.160
and supporting fire wiped out 
the rest of the advancing BETA.

00:23:22.920 --> 00:23:25.570
The Far East Lines remain intact.

00:23:26.590 --> 00:23:29.590
The Soviet Government gave the title 
"Hero of the Russian Federation"

00:23:29.590 --> 00:23:32.580
to all soldiers of Zhar Battalion.

00:23:33.200 --> 00:23:34.530
"Heroes"?

00:23:35.890 --> 00:23:40.410
Commander, you were right.  
I was a spoiled kid.

00:23:40.930 --> 00:23:44.590
I was pretending not to see how so 
many other people were protecting me.

00:23:45.360 --> 00:23:47.440
I only saw what was convienent for me.

00:23:47.440 --> 00:23:49.860
I pretended to be a 
victim.  I acted like one.

00:23:50.270 --> 00:23:51.700
But watch me now.

00:23:52.470 --> 00:23:54.290
I swear to all of you.

00:23:55.340 --> 00:24:01.400
Someday, I'll fight to protect 
someone, like you did.
